        <description>Store the value from the multi-select picklist in a text variable that looks like this: Value A;Value B;Value C
Append semicolons to the triggering service indicator&apos;s Value to populate three variables:
1. semicolonAfter (&quot;Value;&quot;)
2. semicolonBefore (&quot;;Value&quot;)
3. bothSemicolons (&quot;;Value;&quot;)</description>
        <name>Assign_Existing_Picklist_Values</name>
        <label>Assign Existing Picklist Values</label>
        <locationX>314</locationX>
        <locationY>779</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>serviceIndicatorMSP</assignToReference>
